        "original_id": "c4ef90fd-8fff-5d31-96c4-7be5e34a159a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Wildsville, Louisiana; Jonesville; Georgia; Alabama; Colorado\n- Roads: U.S. Route 84\n\nFacts:\n- In the original 1926 U.S. highway scheme, U.S. Route 84 was a short route between Georgia and Alabama.\n- By 1941, U.S. Route 84 had been extended all the way to Colorado.\n- Wildsville, Louisiana, is located on U.S. Route 84 about 2 miles east of Jonesville.",
